From: Mercury worker lane 14 (pass2) — Home Dashboard briefing test registration
Subject: [PATCH] Include HomeDashboardBriefingCuiTests.cs in the portable Desktop test target

Base: ddb2a8b813c8189b31556ef2ee491ac4f6f2b4eb
Target: 9to1 Workspace/shared/tests/Haven.Desktop.Tests/Haven.Desktop.Tests.csproj

The portable target (net10.0) disables default Compile items
(EnableDefaultCompileItems=false), so the new HomeDashboardBriefingCuiTests.cs is not compiled
unless explicitly registered. This hunk adds it to the existing net10.0 ItemGroup, preserving all
other lane registrations. The Infrastructure project (Haven.Infrastructure.Tests) does NOT disable
default Compile items, so DashboardBriefingSourceFixtureTests.cs there is included automatically and
requires no registration change.

